pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: |
  年度总览页。四个巨号数字是全年报的锚点，讲述顺序建议：订单 → 里程 → 碳减排 → 用户。每个数字下方的"生活化换算"是这页的记忆点，可放慢语速。所有换算口径自洽：42亿公里 ÷ 4万公里 ≈ 10.5万圈；8.6亿单 ÷ 365天 ÷ 86400秒 ≈ 每秒27单；112万吨 ÷ 单树年固碳约18kg ≈ 6200万棵。
elements:
  - elementId: masthead-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 24, 420, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 两轮城市研究院 · URBAN CYCLING ANNUAL

  - elementId: masthead-folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 24, 340, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: VOL.2025 · No.02 / 07

  - elementId: masthead-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 48, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$ink" }

  - elementId: ch-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 66, 80, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 44
      color: "$orange"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "01"

  - elementId: page-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 72, 500, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 年度总览 · THE YEAR IN NUMBERS

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 92, 750, 38]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 一年 8.6 亿次出发，两轮成为城市的毛细血管

  - elementId: stat1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 190, 190, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      color: "$navy"
      fontSize: 11
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 骑行订单

  - elementId: stat1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 212, 190, 58]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:44px; font-family:Alimama ShuHeiTi; color:$navy;">8.6</span><span style="font-size:16px; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei; color:$ink;"> 亿次</span></p>

  - elementId: stat1-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 280, 185, 66]
    content:
      style: "$serif-note"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 平均到每一秒，全国有 27 辆车被扫码解锁。

  - elementId: stat-sep1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [258, 196, 1, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: stat2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [280, 190, 190, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      color: "$navy"
      fontSize: 11
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 总里程

  - elementId: stat2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [280, 212, 190, 58]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:44px; font-family:Alimama ShuHeiTi; color:$navy;">42</span><span style="font-size:16px; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei; color:$ink;"> 亿公里</span></p>

  - elementId: stat2-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [280, 280, 185, 66]
    content:
      style: "$serif-note"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 首尾相接，约可绕地球 10.5 万圈。

  - elementId: stat-sep2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 196, 1, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: stat3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 190, 190, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      color: "$navy"
      fontSize: 11
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 碳减排

  - elementId: stat3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 212, 190, 58]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:44px; font-family:Alimama ShuHeiTi; color:$orange;">112</span><span style="font-size:16px; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei; color:$ink;"> 万吨</span></p>

  - elementId: stat3-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 280, 185, 66]
    content:
      style: "$serif-note"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 约等于 6,200 万棵树一整年的固碳量。

  - elementId: stat-sep3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [698, 196, 1, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: stat4-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 190, 190, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      color: "$navy"
      fontSize: 11
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 活跃用户

  - elementId: stat4-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 212, 190, 58]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:44px; font-family:Alimama ShuHeiTi; color:$navy;">1.9</span><span style="font-size:16px; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei; color:$ink;"> 亿人</span></p>

  - elementId: stat4-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 280, 180, 66]
    content:
      style: "$serif-note"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 每 5 个城镇居民中，就有 1 位骑行者。

  - elementId: editor-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 396, 36, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$orange" }

  - elementId: editor-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 410, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 编者按

  - elementId: editor-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 432, 840, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Heart Serif MN"
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: 数字本身不会骑车。8.6 亿次订单背后，是 8.6 亿次"最后一公里"的具体人生：赶地铁的清晨、夜归的晚风，和不愿等公交的十分钟。我们试图用数据，把这些瞬间重新读出来。

  - elementId: source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 510, 700, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 数据来源：两轮城市研究院 · 2025 城市骑行监测样本（虚构演示数据）· 换算口径见本页注记
